{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 92, "line_no": 2, "text": "（pai'），用“姑”或“古”来表示布依语的“我”（ku'），用“然”来表示布依语的“家”", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 262, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（pai'），用“姑”或“古”来表示布依语的“我”（ku'），用“然”来表示布依语的“家”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 262, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 92, "line_no": 3, "text": "（ra:n？），用“八”来表示布依语的“妻”（pa’），等等。读音相近是指被借汉字的读音与它", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 326, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（ra:n？），用“八”来表示布依语的“妻”（pa’），等等。读音相近是指被借汉字的读音与它", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 326, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 92, "line_no": 4, "text": "用来表示的布依语词的读音近似，如用“门”（mup’）来表示布依语的“你”，用“议”", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 394, "w": 1544, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "用来表示的布依语词的读音近似，如用“门”（mup’）来表示布依语的“你”，用“议”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 394, "w": 1544, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 92, "line_no": 5, "text": "（nie'）来表示布依语的“听”，用“鲁”（du*）来表示“古时”，等等。无论是借同音还是借", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 463, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（nie'）来表示布依语的“听”，用“鲁”（du*）来表示“古时”，等等。无论是借同音还是借", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 463, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 92, "line_no": 6, "text": "近音，所借汉字与其所代表的布依语在含义上毫无关系。", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 527, "w": 989, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "近音，所借汉字与其所代表的布依语在含义上毫无关系。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 527, "w": 989, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 92, "line_no": 7, "text": "2. 借形词。这类汉字的特点是：其词义与其所表示的布依语词义相同，但读音则不", "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 591, "w": 1475, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "2. 借形词。这类汉字的特点是：其词义与其所表示的布依语词义相同，但读音则不", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 591, "w": 1475, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 92, "line_no": 8, "text": "相同。如“兒”被用来表示布依语“儿”这个词，但布依语读音为［luk*］；“嫁”被用来表示", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 654, "w": 1544, "h": 65}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "相同。如“兒”被用来表示布依语“儿”这个词，但布依语读音为［luk*］；“嫁”被用来表示", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 654, "w": 1544, "h": 65}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 92, "line_no": 9, "text": "布依语的“出嫁”，但布依语读音为［ha’］或［ya’］。用来表示布依语词在音、义上如果与", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 720, "w": 1544, "h": 61}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "布依语的“出嫁”，但布依语读音为［ha’］或［ya’］。用来表示布依语词在音、义上如果与", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 720, "w": 1544, "h": 61}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 92, "line_no": 10, "text": "汉字基本相同的，多为汉语借词。如“内”读为［dau'］或［dai'］，表示“里面”；“早”读力", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 793, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "汉字基本相同的，多为汉语借词。如“内”读为［dau'］或［dai'］，表示“里面”；“早”读力", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 793, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 92, "line_no": 11, "text": "［sau\"］，表示“早”；“匠”读［cazn°］，表示“匠人、师傅”，等等。", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 857, "w": 1106, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "［sau\"］，表示“早”；“匠”读［cazn°］，表示“匠人、师傅”，等等。", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 857, "w": 1106, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 92, "line_no": 12, "text": "3.借偏旁部首重构。这类字的主要表现为：利用汉字的偏旁部首或将汉字作为偏旁", "bbox_px": {"x": 149, "y": 921, "w": 1471, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "3.借偏旁部首重构。这类字的主要表现为：利用汉字的偏旁部首或将汉字作为偏旁", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 149, "y": 921, "w": 1471, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 92, "line_no": 13, "text": "部首，根据汉字“六书”造字法重新组构成文字。此类以形声字最多，其次为会意字。形", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 986, "w": 1548, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "部首，根据汉字“六书”造字法重新组构成文字。此类以形声字最多，其次为会意字。形", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 986, "w": 1548, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 92, "line_no": 14, "text": "声字由声符和义符组成，其特点是：声符借汉字的音表示该字的布依语词读音，义符则借", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 1054, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "声字由声符和义符组成，其特点是：声符借汉字的音表示该字的布依语词读音，义符则借", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 1054, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 92, "line_no": 15, "text": "汉字的意表示该字的布依语含义。例如：", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 1118, "w": 724, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "汉字的意表示该字的布依语含义。例如：", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 1118, "w": 724, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
